{"3948660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Critical Minutes", "steam_appid": 3948660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Minutes is a multiplayer first-person shooter built using Unreal Engine 5, delivering fast-paced action and intense tactical combat. The game features a distinctive art style that brings dynamic maps to life, designed for strategic gameplay and enhanced by immersive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Players can expect  Engaging combat. Environments from container yard to warzones, every battle feels grounded and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo with AI bots, team up with friends, or jump into online matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gamemodes</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Confirmed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free 4 All</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and Destroy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The clock is ticking. War doesn't wait.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Minutes is a multiplayer first-person shooter built using Unreal Engine 5, delivering fast-paced action and intense tactical combat. The game features a distinctive art style that brings dynamic maps to life, designed for strategic gameplay and enhanced by immersive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Players can expect  Engaging combat. Environments from container yard to warzones, every battle feels grounded and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo with AI bots, team up with friends, or jump into online matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gamemodes</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Confirmed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free 4 All</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and Destroy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The clock is ticking. War doesn't wait.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In Critical Minutes, you take on the role of a ruthless terrorist or an elite military operative in a high-stakes first-person shooter. Engage in intense PvP, PvE, and PvPvE combat where every second counts. The clock is ticking. War doesn’t wait. Do you have what it takes to survive the fight?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948660/0d8ed547c2e50bc0aaca9ea0cd492847c8e8b1c3/header.jpg?t=1776239407", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948660/6a0ea28f46e2751a5b03a91a432a273acb17a5a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776239407", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948660/6a0ea28f46e2751a5b03a91a432a273acb17a5a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776239407", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:<